msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We released Quarkus 3.0.3.Final, the second maintenance release of our 3.0 "
"release train (as our first public release for 3.0 was 3.0.1.Final)."
msgstr ""

msgid "As usual, it contains bugfixes and documentation improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 3.0."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not already using 3.0, please refer to https://quarkus.io/blog/"
"quarkus-3-0-final-released/[the Quarkus 3.0 announcement] and in particular "
"the section about the https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-0-final-released/"
"#upgrading[upgrade path to 3.0]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.0.3."
"Final[the full changelog of 3.0.3.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
